              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sueb"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is like the recipe I have been searching for! I love all the vegetables! Fresh herbs might help season this more, but the flavor is fine Next time, I will mix the veggies in a bowl, letting the juices drain out for about an hour, then will add to the mayonnaise mixture. This was a little soupy for my liking, so I think that will help!"
          },
